{"id":"n28326-1-7","stage":2,"title":"놔두다 · 放下","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28326-1-7-1","ko":"어제 빌려 간 내 공책을 어디에 놔두었니?","zh":"我昨天借出去的笔记本，你放在哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려","audio":"/audio/67cc0fe84cbb6a7195bd.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","explanation":"가다：表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28764","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"공책을","meaning":"笔记本","explanation":"공책：笔记本；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공책","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15252","senseId":"1","lemma":"공책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공책을","audio":"/audio/44393d9e40c1deacc2df.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"en